      "text": "AI Coding Dictionary",
      "hash": "4def77f9388809f53620144510fcc4b6f08662617bcc06a15abc618242e6544c"
    },
    {
      "id": "74d28a9852b8f532707eb7171cc03b5c9d588e05cab68bd2c72e3e809f2ca8aa",
      "text": "Topics",
      "hash": "e22820fcf5cd90e3fdd99a7569e0ee2f30eb7ebadfb2fe4d159b30c166ff81b7"
    },
    {
      "id": "e08479c9ee49eead685aff3ce6108eec1a63aadd0fdb49eaed760394f3a5b40e",
      "text": "Patterns of Work",
      "hash": "451912cbee5f0ec6ab7874916ee61c5d7d98c7c960493b524130e6c14b3e3f92"
    },
    {
      "id": "1a464d5262aad4c244c6bb8f9035167ecfb296c8436f71a2264221cbe0727ef8",
      "text": "AFK",
      "hash": "875e0577157f743e3346ba95f1d944d08e54b3cab40d89819dff5f48cd507392"
    },
    {
      "id": "90ba83eddaa59851646d62cdf27147c980cdf09c77dd3ab93492753e1cc78afe",
      "text": "A working pattern where the user kicks off a session and leaves the agent to run unattended (away from keyboard).",
      "hash": "5af849e6da5f286b228b0e7f36c6c7ea2ac98dea488706213c6a9b8d052b37ad"
    },
    {
      "id": "5e75556d8e38b935c27c56648db5d288e10f2b75fddf064019d6e493a7d5c1f1",
      "text": "Matt Pocock",
      "hash": "2fe2c13509fbd45ec2578a74ef8efda313caad4f19533a102ca7d666ed60881d"
    },
    {
      "id": "88970f1c8ad5eefa7188a644feb217cf3b146aee4a562953cb9ccc5dc3ad74b6",
      "text": "Copy page",
      "hash": "4104018941ae3ab016c117887a91b4f933f28e36c587b8983373fe9377ce34d7"
    },
    {
      "id": "e224551ef4cb983eb34f9426186a315a001959d7ec530d1c2cbb64cb1ca559e8",
      "text": "Away from keyboard. A working pattern where the user kicks off a",
      "hash": "8da5dc1f30665835e0a78a761f871c57da42b0debb3d08f926b969bf136113b3"
    },
    {
      "id": "c9deadda39763bb182fe6e1c57623eeca95cd4159836a83323709f2bec24e768",
      "text": "and leaves the",
      "hash": "dfb5a83d2aac8ba37c8b2a3f3c6b20f49cf209629f5cd97b8094988738f86886"
    },
    {
      "id": "b86c4bd4c7c44cdfdda1fe5b8293aa139a6a7f01b6c680344ed2c3ef413236f2",
      "text": "to run unattended. The throughput multiplier of",
      "hash": "4eea73a886c0d2c8878e9751a7cfc32359d0a6ce4530aae7d55b7e76b2f7aa16"
    },
    {
      "id": "41a30d0bf86d75199105b0f63c138124ff2ca01332e9e352f2c2417dd8999b31",
      "text": "coding — many AFK sessions can run in parallel while you sleep, eat, or work on something else. Usually requires a permissive",
      "hash": "ca342243c758ef13e806c2baa542e5573497fdeeaec31947fc1572493a5d3b9c"
    },
    {
      "id": "f53b50d42da09fe5740ff85ec74673ecc1fddc14f47bbced9880972a637b2b87",
      "text": "permission mode",
      "hash": "2ea04b3cff63e2308414a5e48abbef0b69336f0b9902d10bd8b81d8ff46aae26"
    },
    {
      "id": "e465a68ba46c0fa0a615521a9d00b95abad044465c5d1207ad277db8ff14c1f5",
      "text": "to be safe.",
      "hash": "23de20c03096eeef910582e09028f4035e7a1fcb69c40f3433c734ff35d7c3a3"
    },
    {
      "id": "ab1633ca54cfb679d69b659b2d847466bff19f2925fad743400538ccd19f40e4",
      "text": "When you're not there, the agent handles ambiguity differently. While you're watching, an ambiguous decision surfaces as a question and you answer it; once you've walked away, the agent picks a default and keeps going, and every later decision builds on that guess. The characteristic failure is coming back to hours of finished, confident work built on a wrong call made in the first ten minutes. The work isn't sloppy — it's coherent, just coherent about the wrong thing.",
      "hash": "0160c7e1750641a4bfe825984e0cdaf751f9f3e21022caeea513d623e62344f2"
    },
    {
      "id": "936ca11294699969db271f01e29a170baa1d03adf9c10a231c288b2a9f412b49",
      "text": "Since you can't give input during the run, give it before and after instead. Before: resolve the ambiguity up front — a",
      "hash": "57a559231fddea286978d56f3e7d97ec49f504e3387617480798cae94f026173"
    },
    {
      "id": "32a20dc55b0721520a7c086389395a70e60d7b7c9a443392037afdad9f7e8827",
      "text": "session, a written",
      "hash": "7548ee3612328aad5995025a721bd11bd5c51f9a802706518a9cacb707b5e8c1"
    },
    {
      "id": "223c01cc7d0fe8bf6b87becc7bdc6cdaf4b7efbbec3d56511b353b1e9bd4fc7a",
      "text": "— so there are fewer gaps for the agent to fill alone. During:",
      "hash": "6f2e94bd177d950b7192a602248ee8fb755e5b83160ea80bb4fc3f0b31bf57d5"
    },
    {
      "id": "62c44023527534ffe0891ae1a7927f04367975f96e7b35abb13662c4e6e6aba0",
      "text": "automated checks",
      "hash": "f748d6acc6e10f9e80812a46b239b1d2f3f145075600d299b6e40632fb06622b"
    },
    {
      "id": "237fd79ed1b7047f45f3374d2fd68de2d3d81e1176df55c558858e5dfae358cc",
      "text": "automated review",
      "hash": "50f191cd5fc38204b448aef31fe4355cd06753a9cd829931d5b71343757317d6"
    },
    {
      "id": "d38f3bb58e7dd1ea67d5d39a5934efc6afdd2efccf825df55f328bb58e9a52d0",
      "text": "stand in for the attention you're not giving, failing fast on what can be caught mechanically. After: the run ends in something reviewable — a PR, not changes already merged. AFK doesn't remove",
      "hash": "e03073b15bca1180267b776c5f05d04228fc3e5e13bf9197d31fb7b5fde1442a"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0dcbe91bcc33d99be9b94472197d4a9930cf1e9ad2748509c5d9e52147789b2",
      "text": "human review",
      "hash": "978a8b09ee5844e15ea0661d83702e00e6b4312de7dae44479adf0e8d7f5262b"
    },
    {
      "id": "254d5416c5351a41a007614153434fec4b4de10fff1c4e1eef327360464dd21a",
      "text": "; it defers all of it to the end, which is why what arrives at the end has to be worth reviewing. This is also why",
      "hash": "81230a6ac4afb55cefd3d9aab671b4b7d59e7f7c91af4bb3ae131b17dedca3ec"
    },
    {
      "id": "f9e82c9b9b7b8329961b543ee447a404444d9128c8a357f52f4f48a215e9f057",
      "text": "AX",
      "hash": "bbe96fa9f44ea0fcf38b0ec729822f37f5cc11e625753b2a250a90a3b59dd098"
    },
    {
      "id": "039aee86c612a0e89a3c3a4bfae3db98c2ce656d528b8c41403126b7e103fdc2",
      "text": "matters most in AFK runs — with no one watching, the environment is the only support the agent gets.",
      "hash": "54be29659474262554441131084287117052248f27c29ce6be13465018d6ad4e"
    },
    {
      "id": "d2fe39da9eeff652c6f55ba2c8078213bfa9d3b16a422b5d3c136c44612b0ee5",
      "text": "Avoid:",
      "hash": "0c98d3dd1920fdb71269240ba1ce3a7323099760ecd0b295f071aca6b07e30df"
    },
    {
      "id": "62d10380efccf9d01631b087c0e911a9ebeb7fc242f2aac2efb982e12440533c",
      "text": "\"background agent\" — centers the machine (\"running in the background\") rather than the human pattern (\"user has walked away\"). AFK names the fact that matters: the user isn't watching.",
      "hash": "fac9e4afa6e2251c8da1f699880689648a4d5418c5186802f2a1c61e100490b8"
    },
    {
      "id": "ab2272de7fa2ccdfa7e47a7ed47de6ee6568333ae86feacc745ca452e5650996",
      "text": "Usage:",
      "hash": "2bad3eeaf33caffe3bc9b482b4934ed19eb4ec3614c12373e1a5c5f8948217da"
    },
    {
      "id": "324b1938abff31243d07a96b8c09aa2be58678df3cf6c756fe46fd3e16bb82cb",
      "text": "\"I'm running this AFK — three sandboxed agents on the refactor, reviewing the PRs in the morning.\"",
      "hash": "2dd966be5bf35f6f694123526f704d9c71d277d10f21a4f48658cf2de876a20b"
    },
    {
      "id": "4f54c3d8ae866cc3def7a8576f2faed39d2f3a546e86c57d1f91cf430759988e",
      "text": "Bypass permissions",
      "hash": "8f7a3f7fdc58c366e963f56ef977c9b987337235c76304ead6ae285df44f0204"
    },
    {
      "id": "8939fa8e68922ce56fcd08760d41eb83f5961de5b7704165ebd77e125672543b",
      "text": "?\"",
      "hash": "19ea93571d24c1b4a75edb5927269424f305db383b5b4fa0cb71a74252ad701a"
    },
    {
      "id": "f587ff3012e0d103c1b873cf33e5fd6b3bdaf511a7f9e995ba6475e979f0bda6",
      "text": "\"Yeah, read-only",
      "hash": "00fb1013de45e8fae3983d172c184e1b4e92635f95ca65b34e9297f102befd10"
    },
    {
      "id": "30181991cadbefee726c59204fd7acb2750342ac79a964e821ea5b683fed8daa",
      "text": ", no network.\"",
      "hash": "032498134d67c04791c6fafc1d97f5f831dcb0b9aed99a10b5b74dd507994422"
    },
    {
      "id": "72a06f8c87e22eb4d2a9c70ffb3092aeb25a04092ce5e29673fa18da4410d55d",
      "text": "Previous term",
      "hash": "735604aff9e8f2192b83df4905cfc8e395613e0ce05f8ca85a1d2d1d44fd59f3"
    },
    {
      "id": "213cf8e42184f6dc2a182a796b36905752fa25eec816e3e11809c9016be7c2a8",
      "text": "Human-in-the-loop",
      "hash": "014893d767fb10c9f698bbc84894647de33135dacd220fcf7b22451b55c64e6f"
    },
    {
      "id": "5b394a62e37e453fa5876599ba5ab872d5c6e17c61159c85daba396fdf33589e",
      "text": "Next term",
      "hash": "5219c7ebdc0e098aa6db6f09e405c1b17ab75f1082862906a872e10a16818f9e"
    },
    {
      "id": "716aa0b29b4d25cbe70efeb422182f74e422499b9e00ef27a8b92e77f56ca361",
      "text": "Automated check",
      "hash": "02f50ca3b316125cc24382d78e247a47971a48880f6655c3cfcfcd84dc3891e9"
    },
    {
      "id": "bde9bc3fb4b5f300577cdc0e2c60b32803678dd55abb52fa0bbd82a0bc1b4e2a",
      "text": "Want more than vocabulary?",
      "hash": "5d5500a083006a1606e84a03c018904d01364631c6baea4c7a3f8f3f62bf94dc"
    },
    {
      "id": "2bfd2f2af110cb4dde332bc3ce4a45911ef46934b99f924d1d46039c593e69d7",
      "text": "Join AI Hero for practical skills, thinking on AI engineering, and resources that keep you ahead of the curve.",
      "hash": "a082f7147e30da6afe92268d5668a530edfff13e64934f8f63f22c098db86133"
    },
    {
      "id": "3a433b550df66193accb5870580cf25c5365555e636936a9dd00448c18d77ce3",
      "text": "First Name",
      "hash": "96ce6e6193a047260f5c32aa416d88b6e8959111f43f98457af9cc009a0907ad"
    },
    {
      "id": "f28afcd3b82ee13149becfd63cb7afad45c324aa874099ceb03103acfba7cc22",
      "text": "Email*",
      "hash": "61dff02026341a6e553a56fc2ba214a76ad68c18cc67bf732993cfdbd51bb8b4"
    },
    {
      "id": "912528f0992e15fa4682031c2ae49ed2610192d6912d653ed72a4d0a6649e439",
      "text": "Get AI Hero updates",
      "hash": "81b46eab414c141d6dcd85a5bd534179bf54a3532469436d693c437e9de3a90a"
    },
    {
